{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL12.7",
  "chapter": "NL12",
  "title": "元素总数与空乘积",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p10-tensor.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:7788066e0e6accbcefb6f26233a34f1f437b4a56e00fef2653ed18d3c4dde124"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "c02b35dce350b9ee697fe098a85acf42bbac5c5a",
  "notebook_dirty": false,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL12.7:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$\\text{Size}()=\\prod_d\\text{shape}[d]$；秩 0（标量）时**空乘积为 1**。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL12.7:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "标量必须有一个元素而不是零个；否则「$1\\times1$ 矩阵」与「标量」的运算语义会分裂。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL12.7:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "任一维为 0 $\\Rightarrow\\text{Size}=0$（合法空张量，不是错误）；含 0 维时**秩仍照算**（$\\{2,0,3\\}$ 的秩是 3、元素数 0）。成立条件：形状非负。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL12.7:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "空张量与标量分别用例；`0×0` 的写盘/读回（对应 NOW 的 npy 契约）也要能过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL12.7:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "T1。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL12.7:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「元素数为 0 就是秩为 0」。秩是维数、元素数是乘积；$\\{0\\}$ 的秩是 1、元素数是 0。"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
